record raw-autotune.evidence.compression-ratio-batch-gate/1 : evidence {
    title "The ratio test preserved luminance and exact midtones. On _DSC1289 profile plus exponent 0.6 reduced sky green deficit to 7.6%, but the 58-frame gate rejected promotion because maximum hard clipping rose 0.204% to 3.178% and maximum near-white share rose 2.0% to 28.0%."
