    result pass
    method command
    observed_at git:ff74d3b248f65ea98bde93578a3b95c80a647181
    command "cargo test tone::tests::color_ratio_exponent_reduces_only_compressed_chroma_and_preserves_luminance --lib; compare 58 decoded JPEGs against output2/raw_3rd_batch"
    artifact "CHANGELOG.md"
    summary """
        The ratio test preserved luminance and exact midtones. On _DSC1289 profile plus exponent 0.6 reduced sky green deficit to 7.6%, but the 58-frame gate rejected promotion because maximum hard clipping rose 0.204% to 3.178% and maximum near-white share rose 2.0% to 28.0%.
        """
}

