record raw-autotune.evidence.sky-stage-attribution-20260809/1 : evidence {
    title "36 tone tests passed. The pre-change and renderer-exact diagnostic renders had identical SHA-256 386a90ebbc5c8032a0f84f0f614277e0b367f0fbc880d6fb5fd50df40db1d7e0. In the fixed upper-sky crop, p90 clip-boundary a/b step was 0.00423 after reconstruction, 0.01922 after the tone curve, 0.01930 after chroma, 0.01605 before and after gamut, and 0.01612 final; reconstruction-off final was 0.00313, local-tone 0.35 was 0.01618, and HDR 0.5 was 0.01663. Current classification counted 344861 pixels with at least two clipped channels and zero with three."
