record raw-autotune.evidence.uncertainty-gate-consolidation/1 : evidence {
    title "Local-tone/HDR gates rewired onto the raw-domain uncertainty map"
    state verified
    result pass
    method command
    observed_at git:ff74d3b248f65ea98bde93578a3b95c80a647181
    command "cargo test --release && raw-autotune raw/raw_3rd_batch --dry-run --summary before|after.json --jobs 8 && raw-autotune <sky cohort> --dry-run --hdr 0.5 --summary hdr_before|after.json"
    summary """
        localtone::build and build_hdr now consume highlight's per-pixel reconstruction-uncertainty map instead of re-deriving a developed-pixel proxy; default output byte-identical over raw/raw_3rd_batch (58 frames), --hdr 0.5 highlight compression rises 18.5->19.0 / 16.1->18.3 / 20.9->25.8 / 26.8->29.1 / 19.0->18.3 % on _DSC1282/1283/1288/1289/1290 with EV caps and shadow-lift fraction unchanged; 277 lib tests pass.
